[[compiler-libmorloc]]
=== Runtime library API

**STUB**: Specifies the C ABI that language bindings are written against: the
ABI version and the rule for when it changes, the error-reporting convention
every fallible function follows, and memory ownership across the boundary.
Lists the binding-facing types and functions in collapsible tables grouped by
purpose: shared memory, schemas, packing and unpacking, packets, Arrow,
caching, intrinsics, and utilities. Functions used only by the nexus are out of
scope.

